## vendored / patched copy

This directory is a PATCHED COPY of upstream tracel-ai/cubek
(https://github.com/tracel-ai/cubek) — crate `cubek-reduce` at 0.3.0-pre.4 —
redistributed under the same dual license as upstream (`MIT OR Apache-2.0`, per
the crate's `Cargo.toml`).

The upstream copyright notice above is retained deliberately. This file was
previously EMPTY while the vendored code declared `MIT OR Apache-2.0`.

Patch applied by dormouse (`docs/adr/0015-topk-gather.md`):

- `src/components/instructions/topk.rs` and `base.rs` — two hunks. 0.3.0-pre.4's
  `reaches` fast-path guard cannot tell an empty top-k slot from one holding
  `-inf`, so a masked score row emits the `u32::MAX` seed coordinate as an index
  and the caller's gather reads out of bounds. The fix is in the kernel rather
  than at any call site, plus a coordinate clamp on the way out.

This directory is required for the project to build at all: the root
`[patch.crates-io]` maps `cubek-reduce` here, and the whole family was once
untracked, so a fresh clone had a patch entry pointing at a missing path.
